"description":"Choice of Life: Wild Island — a text RPG with card mechanics about choice, survival, and fate on a deserted island.\n \n You are an ordinary sailor who survived a shipwreck. Now the island is your new home: there are no familiar rules here, and every decision can open a path to rescue, lead to a dangerous discovery, grant a new skill, or unexpectedly end your adventure.\n \n What awaits you:\n \n— Nonlinear story\n Every decision changes the course of the story and opens new branches.\n \n— Survival on the island\n Explore trails, find shelter, gather resources, and avoid deadly mistakes.\n \n— Unexpected consequences\n The obvious choice can lead to death, while a strange decision can save your life.\n \n— Multiple endings\n Replay the story, discover new paths, and change the ending.\n \n What choices will you make after the shipwreck? Will you try to find your way home or start a new life among the island’s mysteries, dangers, and trials?\n \n Choose. Explore. Survive.\n The ending depends only on you!", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "sellerUrl":"https://retrowavepublishing.com/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "FR", "DE", "JA", "KO", "ZH", "ES", "ZH"], "fileSizeBytes":"416036864", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackContentRating":"12+", "genreIds":["6014", "7014", "7015"], "userRatingCount":0}, 
